    "opinions": [
      {
        "text": "First exception to the Special Master\u2019s First Interim Report is set for oral argument in due course. Second exception is recommitted to the Special Master. Wyoming\u2019s motion to dismiss denied. Motion of the Special Master for allowance of fees and reimbursement of expenses granted, and the Special Master is awarded a total of $72,008.74 for the period June 13, 2009, through July 9, 2010, to be paid equally by Montana and Wyoming. Justice Kagan took no part in the consideration or decision of these exceptions and these motions. [For earlier order herein, see, e. g., 559 U. S. 989.]",
